# weatherbug.com

> WeatherBug provides hyperlocal weather data, real-time alerts, forecasts, and interactive maps to help users plan their day and stay safe during severe weather.
> AI-readable markdown representation of the 10 day forecast pages are available at /markdown/weather-forecast/10-day-weather/[location-code] for crawlers that prefer structured plaintext over rendered HTML.

WeatherBug offers comprehensive weather information including current conditions, forecast conditions, radar imagery, and weather alerts.

All location-specific forecasts use the pattern `/weather-forecast/[view]/[location-code]`

## Forecasts

- [Now](/weather-forecast/now/[location-code]):  provides a comprehensive overview of current weather conditions and forecasts for specific locations.
- [Hourly Forecast](/weather-forecast/hourly/[location-code]):  Hour-by-hour weather predictions for the next 144 hours by location.
- [10-Day Forecast](/weather-forecast/10-day-weather/[location-code]):  An extended weather outlook providing a summary of expected conditions and high/low temperatures for the next ten days.
- [10-Day Forecast (markdown)](/markdown/weather-forecast/10-day-weather/[location-code]):  An extended weather outlook providing a summary of expected conditions and high/low temperatures for the next ten days.

## Maps
- [Interactive Map](/maps): A wide array of interactive maps and visualizations for tracking weather and environmental variables.

## Alerts
- [All Alerts](/alerts/[location-code]):  Dedicated to monitoring and understanding all weather and environmental hazards for a given location.
- [Weather](/alerts/weather/[location-code]):  All active National Weather Service Warnings, Watches, and Advisories for a given location.
- [Spark](/alerts/lightning/[location-code]):  Provides the precise distance between a location and the closest lightning detected. 
- [Hurricane](/alerts/hurricane/[location-code]): All information and alerts related to tropical cyclones
- [Fire](/alerts/fire/[location-code]): Real-time wildfire tracking and future fire risk forecasts
- [Pollen](/alerts/pollen/[location-code]): All active alerts related to the forecast of high pollen conditions
- [Air Quality](/alerts/air-quality/[location-code]): All active alerts related to current air quality conditions 
- [Severe Storm Risk](/alerts/severe-storm-risk/[location-code]): All active alerts communicating the overall threat level for severe thunderstorms today

## Life

- [Allergies & Pollen](/life/pollen/[location-code]):  Forecasts that show the upcoming airborne allergen conditions in your local environment
- [Cold & Flu](/life/cold-flu/[location-code]):  Provides a local cold and flu outlook.
- [Outdoor Sports](/life/outdoor-sports/[location-code]): Detailed weather forecasts for participating in Outdoor sports, including optimal conditions and warnings for dangerous weather.

## News & Videos

- [News](/news): Editorial and informational portal focused entirely on weather-related events, forecasts, and seasonal topics.
- [Videos](/weather-videos):  A library of video content, including narrated forecasts, explanations of complex weather phenomena, and dramatic footage of weather events.

## Cameras

- [Weather Cams](/weather-camera/[location-code]):  Webcams providing a live look at the sky and local conditions in the user's immediate vicinity or surrounding towns.
- [Beach Weather Cams](/weather-camera/categories/beach-cams):  Live video feeds of coastal areas, allowing users to check water conditions, crowds, and weather at beaches.
- [City-Skylines Weather Cams](/weather-camera/categories/city-skylines):  Webcams positioned to capture wide views of urban skylines, often used to monitor weather over a metropolitan area.
- [Mountain Weather Cams](/weather-camera/categories/mountain-cams):  Live feeds from high-altitude locations and ski resorts, showing snow depth, visibility, and current mountain weather conditions.
- [Stadiums Weather Cams](/weather-camera/categories/stadium-cams):  Live views of major sports stadiums, useful for checking game-day weather or field conditions.
- [Cool-Spots Weather Cams](/weather-camera/categories/cool-spots):  Cool Spot Cams:  A curated collection of unique, scenic, or particularly interesting live camera feeds.
- [Traffic Cams](/traffic-cam/[location-code]):  Real-time views of road conditions, congestion, and visibility for drivers.

